{
  "name": "knowhow_draft",
  "description": "Turn an owner's reply into a draft page they save in one step (question_ids, reply word for word, reply_who, reply_where). With body_md it's saved as written; without, the writer drafts it from the reply and the questions. With article_id and step (a question asked mid-walk) it becomes a proposed change to that step. Call it when the owner's reply comes back.",
